From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:23:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Phase 2: audit all 87 existing listings against sources

- Every active listing now has a source URL (most with a second source) and verifiedDate 2026-09-28
- Duplicates: 2 Columbus church records merged (marked duplicate, hidden)
- Closed: Queen of Sheba NYC (closure reported 2025, Yelp closed)
- Address corrections: Gospel Believers (Sterling), VELC Mekane Yesus (Alexandria),
  Atlanta Abo (Stone Mountain), Columbus-area groceries (Whitehall/Reynoldsburg)
- Downgraded 'verified' records lacking strong evidence to community / needs-review,
  with public notes where addresses conflict or closure is suspected
- Added metro field so Whitehall, Reynoldsburg, Pataskala group under Columbus, etc.
- Phones and websites added from official sites

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C51joV1bn4EuCSjgvACjRz
